ds</strong>: Dividends are 0 whenever NET trades at or below NAV. Realised APY depends entirely on sustained market premium.</li>\n<li><strong>Dilution risk</strong>: Management holds a perpetually renewable option to mint up to 15% of circulating supply at 1 USDG per NET, creating ongoing NAV drag.</li>\n<li><strong>Counterparty risk</strong>: Up to 70% of reserves are deployed to Morpho — smart contract failures or liquidity events at Morpho could impact the backing.</li>\n<li><strong>Custody risk</strong>: The guardian key is controlled by a 1-of-1 Safe (management-controlled), not a multi-sig.</li>\n<li><strong>No governance escape hatch</strong>: The protocol cannot pause, patch bugs, or adjust parameters — formulas execute identically regardless of market conditions.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>(From Underlying Protocol <a href=\"https://docs.netnet.capital/risks\">here</a>)</strong></p>","importantQuirks":"<p>This market has no special quirks</p>","initiatedBy":"Pendle Team","conversionRate":{"rate":3.195741457,"fromUnit":"sNET","toUnit":"NET"},"utilizedProtocols":[{"id":"netnet","url":"https://app.netnet.capital/","name":"NetNet","imageUrl":"https://storage.googleapis.com/prod-pendle-bucket-a/images/uploads/dc992eb8-0ed8-415e-aeb2-256a2e5c4d6d.svg"}],"deposit":{"url":"https://app.netnet.capital/#/invest","description":"Pendle Router automatically finds the best route between native minting and DEX swapping"},"withdrawal":{"url":"https://app.netnet.capital/#/invest","description":"Pendle Router automatically finds the best route between native withdrawal and DEX swapping"}}},{"name":"SHROOM","protocol":"Pons","icon":"https://storage.googleapis.com/prod-pendle-bucket-a/images/uploads/b390b4c8-3273-4bf5-9377-4f912d591f50.svg","address":"0x25f241538bc3de8f7130706827b3f6946db51f5d","expiry":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z","pt":"4663-0x20636ab8f3dea231f30396eeba184eff2f3ba72b","yt":"4663-0x06b6c573f0f138a4d2731a8c96ea14f63c6c4a62","sy":"4663-0xe24a28fe8ecd859db4280d12917