"limitOrderIncentive":0},"marketInfo":{"assetDescription":"<p>sNUKE is the rebasing staked version of NUKE from NUKES.FUN, a treasury protocol on Robinhood Chain whose stated goal is to accumulate Nano Nuclear Energy (NASDAQ: NNE) stock. NUKE is acquired on the open market or by bonding USDG at a discount with a five-day linear vest, and each NUKE is backed by a share of the protocol treasury.</p>\n<p>Staking NUKE mints sNUKE, which rebases every eight hours — three times per day — as newly issued NUKE is distributed to stakers and compounds automatically. The treasury acquires NNE through OTC execution with an Authorized Participant able to mint NNE stock tokens directly, rather than buying them on the open market. See the <a href=\"https://nukes.fun/manual\">NUKES.FUN protocol manual</a> for the full design.</p>","riskInvolved":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Emission-funded yield</strong>: the staking APY is paid in newly minted NUKE, not external revenue. It is a dilution split between stakers and non-stakers, so a high headline APY does not by itself imply a gain in value — backing per NUKE is what matters.</li>\n<li><strong>Single-asset treasury</strong>: backing is concentrated in one small-cap NASDAQ equity. A drawdown in NNE passes straight through to NUKE's backing.</li>\n<li><strong>Tokenized-equity counterparty risk</strong>: NNE exposure is held as stock tokens minted by an Authorized Participant. Mint and redemption depend on that party and the issuer, and the token can dislocate from the underlying share price outside US market hours.</li>\n<li><strong>No shareholder rights</strong>: NUKE and sNUKE confer no ownership or shareholder rights in NNE.</li>\n<li><strong>Team issuance</strong>: an Incentives Bond activates above a $33M NUKE market cap, with cumulative issuance capped at 10% of NUKE supply.</li>\n<li><strong>New protocol, thin liquidity</strong>: NUKE trades in a single protocol-owned NUKE/USDG concentrated-liquidity pool on GigaDEX; protocol-owned positions sit behind a multisig and timelock.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>(From Underlying Protocol <a href=\"https://nukes.fun/manual\">here</a>)</strong></p>","importantQuirks":"<p>Bonded NUKE vests linearly over five days; there is no instant native mint of NUKE from USDG at par.</p>","initiatedBy":"Pendle Team","conversionRate":{"rate":1.11006798,"fromUnit":"sNUKE","toUnit":"NUKE"},"utilizedProtocols":[{"id":"nukes.fun","url":"https://nukes.fun/","name":"NUKES.FUN","imageUrl":"https://storage.googleapis.com/prod-pendle-bucket-a/images/uploads/9de3c86e-7b03-4222-9b52-0e07e42c8927.svg"}],"deposit":{"url":"https://nukes.fun/stake","description":"Pendle Router automatically finds the best route between native minting and DEX swapping"},"withdrawal":{"url":"https://nukes.fun/stake","description":"Pendle Router automatically finds the best route between native withdrawal and DEX swapping"}}},{"name":"PFE","protocol":"Robinhood","icon":"https://storage.googleapis.com/prod-pendle-bucket-a/images/uploads/b6f54e28-8d0a-4de4-a806-dcf5fd6c8785.svg","address":"0x892defbf510d9baa96dbd2a51b13e879a857a79b","expiry":"2026-12-10T00:00:00.000Z","pt":"4663-0xf9cd484f7e7799ae32b7f9a75e60c478fd1f0b6e","yt":"4663-0x7600d0a61f83d7e4c4154c4664b19be6d9acf180","sy":"4663-0x8c7454d4d64abd04fbf5f5ffe0dbcd5e3abcecf6","underlyingAsset":"4663-0x7066a64c24e4206cd62e83bf198c1e7eb361f51e","accountingAsset":"4663-0x7066a64c24e4206cd62e83bf198c1e7eb361f51e","rewardTokens":["4663-0x5e49e1f85813f2b65858860a3fa231b4186f2e0e"],"inputTokens":["4663-0x7066a64c24e4206cd62e83bf198c1e7eb361f51e"],"outputTokens":["4663-0x7066a64c24e4206cd62e83bf198c1e7eb361f51e"],"details":{"liquidity":83816.08908447734,"totalTvl":84845.83034133389,"tradingVolume":22.80463517498381,"underlyingApy":0,"swapFeeApy":0.0017433529698676065,"pendleApy":0.0053511006015293065,"ytFloatingApy":-1,"impliedApy":0.0611140535152479,"feeRate":0.0011531737895293936,"yieldRange":{"min":0,"max":0.11999999999999998},"aggregatedApy":0.03878407407382886