n Robinhood Chain. Each token is backed 1:1 by underlying shares held with a licensed custodian and monitored daily, and is accessible around the clock.</p>\n<p>Yield comes from the company's dividends. Corporate actions are applied onchain through a multiplier that adjusts the shares-per-token ratio.</p>\n<p>At maturity:<br></p>\n<p><strong>PT</strong> redeems for one PFIZER share's worth of PFE. Because the multiplier raises the shares behind each token over time, this settles as slightly less than one whole PFE token.</p>\n<p><strong>YT</strong> collects the dividends paid to one PFIZER share over the life of the market.</p>","riskInvolved":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Issuer credit risk</strong>: Stock Tokens are tokenised debt securities issued by Robinhood Assets (Jersey) Limited. A holder's claim is against the issuer, with no legal or beneficial rights in, or against the issuer of, the underlying shares.</li>\n<li><strong>Dividend risk</strong>: yield depends entirely on the company continuing to declare dividends. Dividend policy can be cut or suspended at any time, and realised yield would fall to zero.</li>\n</ul>\n","importantQuirks":"<p>This market has no special quirks</p>","initiatedBy":"Pendle Team","conversionRate":{"rate":1,"fromUnit":"PFE","toUnit":"PFE Shares"},"utilizedProtocols":[{"id":"robinhood","url":"https://robinhood.com/us/en/crypto/","name":"Robinhood","imageUrl":"https://storage.googleapis.com/prod-pendle-bucket-a/images/uploads/ca92d69d-6e0a-4448-8fcd-04608d7eb8ed.svg"}],"deposit":{"description":"Pendle Router automatically finds the best route between native minting and DEX swapping"},"withdrawal":{"description":"Pendle Router automatically finds the best route between native withdrawal and DEX swapping"}}},{"name":"sNET","protocol":"NetNet","icon":"https://storage.googleapis.com/prod-pendle-bucket-a/images/uploads/91daaab6-70f6-4961-8e72-7406f534ebe3.svg","address":"0xab0093949fefa432bfb1a0ba8943ee4aebc898a8","expiry":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z