res or liquidity events at Morpho could impact the backing.</li>\n<li><strong>Custody risk</strong>: The guardian key is controlled by a 1-of-1 Safe (management-controlled), not a multi-sig.</li>\n<li><strong>No governance escape hatch</strong>: The protocol cannot pause, patch bugs, or adjust parameters — formulas execute identically regardless of market conditions.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>(From Underlying Protocol <a href=\"https://docs.netnet.capital/risks\">here</a>)</strong></p>","importantQuirks":"<p>This market has no special quirks</p>","initiatedBy":"Pendle Team","conversionRate":{"rate":3.552754681,"fromUnit":"sNET","toUnit":"NET"},"utilizedProtocols":[{"id":"netnet","url":"https://app.netnet.capital/","name":"NetNet","imageUrl":"https://storage.googleapis.com/prod-pendle-bucket-a/images/uploads/dc992eb8-0ed8-415e-aeb2-256a2e5c4d6d.svg"}],"deposit":{"url":"https://app.netnet.capital/#/invest","description":"Pendle Router automatically finds the best route between native minting and DEX swapping"},"withdrawal":{"url":"https://app.netnet.capital/#/invest","description":"Pendle Router automatically finds the best route between native withdrawal and DEX swapping"}}},{"name":"SGOV","protocol":"Robinhood","icon":"https://storage.googleapis.com/prod-pendle-bucket-a/images/uploads/5d940d11-688d-43b5-9f05-bb0eef09ed7e.svg","address":"0xd6e26e957b3207a5c618213d928647ec84150ca0","expiry":"2026-11-19T00:00:00.000Z","pt":"4663-0x9f1e57d8984d9ae2b081ed6fceff2fb60cb785f1","yt":"4663-0x7eee53b86290e58179ed96bea7887a37e8a1b7b9","sy":"4663-0x06fc2568fa3c8a9862d8f35bc6758355b3a32f51","underlyingAsset":"4663-0x92fd66527192e3e61d4ddd13322aa222de86f9b5","accountingAsset":"4663-0x92fd66527192e3e61d4ddd13322aa222de86f9b5","rewardTokens":["4663-0x5e49e1f85813f2b65858860a3fa231b4186f2e0e"],"inputTokens":["4663-0x92fd66527192e3e61d4ddd13322aa222de86f9b5"],"outputTokens":["4663-0x92fd66527192e3e61d4ddd13322aa222de86f9b5"],"details":{"liquidity":22766.922619555608,"totalTvl":22798.9