ive":0.05409107952355425,"discretionaryIncentive":0,"cobribingIncentive":0,"limitOrderIncentive":0.04845012308787722},"marketInfo":{"assetDescription":"<p>SGOV is a Stock Token issued by Robinhood Assets (Jersey) Limited, giving economic exposure to the iShares 0-3 Month Treasury Bond ETF. Each token is backed 1:1 by underlying shares held with a licensed custodian and monitored daily, and is accessible around the clock.</p>\n<p>The fund holds short-dated US Treasury bills and distributes the interest it collects as yield.</p>\n<p>At maturity:<br></p>\n<p><strong>PT</strong> redeems for one SGOV share's worth of SGOV. Because the multiplier raises the shares behind each token over time, this settles as slightly less than one whole SGOV token.</p>\n<p><strong>YT</strong> collects the dividends (i.e. the interest received from the short-term US Treasury bill) paid to one SGOV share over the life of the market.</p>","riskInvolved":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Issuer credit risk</strong>: Stock Tokens are tokenised debt securities issued by Robinhood Assets (Jersey) Limited. A holder's claim is against the issuer, with no legal or beneficial rights in, or against the issuer of, the underlying shares.</li>\n<li><strong>Rate risk</strong>: yield tracks short-dated US Treasury bill rates. If those rates fall, the distribution yield falls with them. The fund's very short duration limits price risk but does not remove reinvestment risk.</li>\n</ul>\n","importantQuirks":"<p>This market has no special quirks</p>","initiatedBy":"Pendle Team","conversionRate":{"rate":1.005101770003215,"fromUnit":"SGOV","toUnit":"SGOV on Robinhood"},"utilizedProtocols":[{"id":"robinhood","url":"https://robinhood.com/us/en/crypto/","name":"Robinhood","imageUrl":"https://storage.googleapis.com/prod-pendle-bucket-a/images/uploads/ca92d69d-6e0a-4448-8fcd-04608d7eb8ed.svg"}],"deposit":{"description":"Pendle Router automatically finds the best route between native minting and DEX swapping"},"withdrawal":{"descri